Recommendations to use SEM-CNA for replication testing [@du2025; @kan2020] should therefore be treated cautiously, since SEM-CNA is not a test of network equality.

## Network estimation

Our results reinforce that glasso should not be used as a default for model selection. 
Known weaknesses of glasso emerged in our study, particularly weak specificity with rising $N$, while atan, nodewise and ggmModSelect performed more favorably, in line with previous comparative evaluations [@isvoranu2023; @nehler2024; @williams2019].

